## How to Use These Templates

1. Copy the template file into the relevant project folder
2. Rename it to reflect the project (e.g., `PRD-payments-onboarding.md`)
3. Work through each section top to bottom — resist the urge to skip ahead
4. Leave Section 10 (Test & Validation) and Section 11 (Agent Handoff) for last,
   after requirements are stable
5. Treat the document as a living record — update it as decisions change,
   questions resolve, and test results come in

